"Dear {client},\n"
"Under our fee agreement, the instalment \"{fee}\" of {amount} is due on {due_date}.\n"
"Thank you.\n"
"{office}"
msgstr ""
"السيد/السيدة {client} المحترم،\n"
"بموجب عقد الأتعاب، تستحق الدفعة «{fee}» بمبلغ {amount} بتاريخ {due_date}.\n"
"مع الشكر.\n"
"{office}"

#. module: legal_department_management
#: model:legal.letter.template,body:legal_department_management.ldm_message_statement_ready
